<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_32> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_32__subsec_6> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
