<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Seseorang pegawai penguat kuasa hendaklah, bagi maksud melaksanakan Akta ini, mempunyai kuasa untuk melakukan segala atau mana-mana daripada perbuatan yang berikut:"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
