<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "menghendaki pengemukaan rekod, akaun, dan dokumen daripada mana-mana orang berhubung dengan mana-mana hal atau kesalahan di bawah Akta ini dan meneliti, memeriksa dan menyalin mana-mana rekod, akaun dan dokumen itu;"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1__para_b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "menghendaki pengemukaan apa-apa dokumen pengenalan daripada mana-mana orang berhubung dengan mana-mana hal atau kesalahan di bawah Akta ini; atau"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
