<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_IV__cl_56__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Apabila menerima suatu permohonan di bawah subseksyen (1) pihak berkuasa pelesenan hendaklah mengeluarkan pengakuterimaan penerimaan kepada orang itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_IV__cl_56__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_IV__cl_56> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
