<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Industri Biobahan Api Malaysia 2006."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@/~part_I__cl_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/44/msa@> .
